hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"189","Dhahabaẓ-ẓama', wabtallati ‘l-`urūq, wa thabata ‘l-'ajru in shā Allāh. ¤ ¤ The thirst is gone, the veins are moistened, and the reward is confirmed, if Allah wills."
"190","Allāhumma innī as'aluka bi raḥmatika ‘l-latī wasi`at kulla shay' an taghfira lī. ¤ ¤ O Allah, I ask You by Your mercy, which encompasses all things, that You forgive me."
